ity vector at time $t$ can be found using\n\n$$\nv=u+at,\n$$\n\nwhere $u$ is the initial velocity, and $a$ is the acceleration of the particle.\n\nHere, we have\n\n$$\nu=-3i+5j,\\,a=2i-j.\n$$\n\nTherefore, after $t=4\\,\\text{s},$ the velocity of the particle will be\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =u+at \\\\  & =(-3i+5j)+(2i-j)(4) \\\\  & =(-3i+5j)+(8i-4j) \\\\  & =(5i+1j)\\,\\text{m/s}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-317195/field-1" "q-317195/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7439a96f-07b1-5673-a103-af2c63c25d18"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-317195"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-136342/selection/9ae0aed04b9b74e8b5e8470ab51c0700ce94ce3bc9ccccc5c39ed542f9d231a7" :answer/id #uuid "baaea489-308b-59fd-bff5-fcaf5b002b16" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(20i+4j)\\,\\text{km/h}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-136342/selection/fa1ae3374a9ebb81d7b606d5d1052455328df646af7bc25ac01f6904ff3bb493" :answer/id #uuid "8369182c-65e6-501c-8d7b-844bfd18614e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(5i+13j)\\,\\text{km/h}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-136342/selection/13ac7a2504a4805887eae41c4adfcb4a0258a0b1cce6e6c8d61930a884d3c92f" :answer/id #uuid "b613c9d1-0613-5f6a-b05e-ca23fe414135" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(12j)\\,\\text{km/h}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-136342/selection/65c43253eecf4c5bc5dcbc130c404ed519ac343b7fe73869bd5d33048c65867f" :answer/id #uuid "8b1344ac-fb93-57b7-b128-3ee05cd48b9a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(17i+j)\\,\\text{km/h}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-136342/selection/a323b050280bd4a476209554c5b4f8d34f8989caf4ab2afea64728759b36e8ac" :answer/id #uuid "a4c0acf5-9465-57e7-8062-efea4b5a540d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(5i+4j)\\,\\text{km/h}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-136342/selection" :answer-fie