"The initial velocity of a particle is $(5i-j)\\,\\text{km/h}.$ Find the speed of the particle after $2$ hours if the particle moves with a constant acceleration of $(i+3j)\\,{\\text{km/h}}^{2}.$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that when a particle moves with constant acceleration, the velocity vector at time $t$ can be found using\n\n$$\nv=u+at,\n$$\n\nwhere $u$ is the initial velocity, and $a$ is the acceleration of the particle.\n\nHere, we have\n\n$$\nu=5i-j,\\,a=i+3j.\n$$\n\nTherefore, after $2$ hours, the velocity of the particle will be\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =u+at \\\\  & =(5i-j)+(i+3j)(2) \\\\  & =(5i-j)+(2i+6j) \\\\  & =(7i+5j)\\,\\text{km/h}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the speed of the particle is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|v| & =|7i+5j| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{7}^{2}+{5}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{49+25} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{74}\\,\\text{km/h}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-136288/selection/ma-v1/b02a9ebbcb2e6cef7d28ea0a7011a89c7552c1f36d7b11f03a23c8d9895f0be3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-318173/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "76535a56-6401-5ad8-93ed-9d203580d65f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-318173/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "6c030dff-f8db-5f94-9330-67fb65652da0" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-318173/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-field/choices ["q-318173/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-318173/field-2/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "5e701220-783a-5611-a3e8-9f10dcaa332c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-318173/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "46